cro-lens depends on third-party Python packages under their own licences,
installed by uv from PyPI and listed in pyproject.toml and uv.lock. None of
them is modified or bundled in this repository.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; the licence text and copyright lines ship next
to the files in src/cro_lens/web/static/fonts/OFL.txt):
- Source Serif 4 — https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-serif
- Inter Tight — https://github.com/rsms/inter-tight
- JetBrains Mono — https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

The example reports in examples/ quote short passages of public landing pages
and include small crops of them, as the evidence for each finding. The pages
belong to their owners; the quotes are there to show what the tool checked.
